I reach my office building.
The security guard is standing near the door.
He is looking at everyone's ID cards.
I show my ID card.
"Good morning," I say.
"Good morning, madam," he says.
I walk inside the office.
The office is very quiet now.
Some people are working.
I reach my desk.
I put the bag on the chair.
I sit there.
I turn on my computer.
The computer is turning on.
I open the email.
Today there are many new emails.
I am reading the emails.
